From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:33:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/25] plan9: file locks with DMEXCL:
 std::os::plan9::fs::lock_file (an exclusive-use file opened alone, kept alive
 against the server's lock timeout as upas does; "file is locked" is
 WouldBlock), rustc's flock and cargo use it

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
